            },
            {
              "text": "The water animal lived in the water and waited quietly for food.",
              "audioStart": 116.65,
              "audioEnd": 120
            },
            {
              "text": "When the young animal asked his question, the water animal told him to come closer.",
              "audioStart": 120.862,
              "audioEnd": 125.237
            },
            {
              "text": "Suddenly, the water animal caught his little nose part and pulled very hard.",
              "audioStart": 126.1,
              "audioEnd": 130.113
            },
            {
              "text": "A long pull started between the small animal and the large river creature.",
              "audioStart": 130.975,
              "audioEnd": 134.713
            },
            {
              "text": "While they pulled against each other, his nose part stretched and stretched.",
              "audioStart": 135.575,
              "audioEnd": 139.25
            },
            {
              "text": "It became a long form after they pulled for a long time.",
              "audioStart": 140.113,
              "audioEnd": 143
            },
            {
              "text": "Finally, the young animal was able to pull away and escape back home.",
              "audioStart": 143.863,
              "audioEnd": 147.637
            },
            {
              "text": "He ran as fast as he could, and his heart beat fast with fear.",
              "audioStart": 148.5,
              "audioEnd": 151.975
            },
            {
              "text": "He was glad to be free again.",
              "audioStart": 152.838,
              "audioEnd": 154.438
            },
            {
              "text": "He felt the pain in his nose while he ran through the forest.",
              "audioStart": 155.3,
              "audioEnd": 158.137
            },
            {
              "text": "The water animal watched him leave and went back into the deep water.",
              "audioStart": 159,
              "audioEnd": 162.312
            },
            {
              "text": "The journey home was long, but he did not stop for anything.",
              "audioStart": 163.175,
              "audioEnd": 166.338
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "At first, his new long nose part felt very strange to him.",
              "audioStart": 167.2,
              "audioEnd": 170.75
            },
            {
              "text": "However, he soon realized that it was useful for everyday life.",
              "audioStart": 171.613,
              "audioEnd": 175.287
            },
            {
              "text": "He could use it for eating food, drinking water, and moving away bad animals.",
              "audioStart": 176.15,
              "audioEnd": 180.463
            },
            {
              "text": "When he returned home, all the other animals saw his new feature and wanted one too.",
              "audioStart": 181.325,
              "audioEnd": 185.588
            },
            {
              "text": "They looked at him with great surprise, and they could not believe their eyes.",
              "audioStart": 186.45,
              "audioEnd": 190.188
            },
            {
              "text": "His mother and father were also shocked, and they asked him how his nose part became so long.",
              "audioStart": 191.05,
              "audioEnd": 196.025
            },
            {
              "text": "He told them the whole story about the river and the water animal.",
              "audioStart": 196.887,
              "audioEnd": 199.838
            },
            {
              "text": "Then, the other animals decided to make the same journey, and they walked to the great river one by one.",
              "audioStart": 200.7,
              "audioEnd": 206.188
            },
            {
              "text": "They wanted to get long nose parts of their own.",
              "audioStart": 207.05,
              "audioEnd": 209.312
            },
            {
              "text": "When they met the water animal, the same thing happened to them.",
              "audioStart": 210.175,
              "audioEnd": 213.238
            },
            {
              "text": "They all came back home with long nose parts too.",
              "audioStart": 214.1,
              "audioEnd": 216.662
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day on, every animal of that kind had a long nose part.",
              "audioStart": 217.525,
              "audioEnd": 221.1
            },
            {
              "text": "They lived happily and used their new features every day.",
              "audioStart": 221.963,
              "audioEnd": 224.787
            },
            {
              "text": "The young animal was finally happy because he had found his answer.",
              "audioStart": 225.65,
              "audioEnd": 228.9
            },
            {
              "text": "He never stopped asking questions, though, and he always found new things to learn.",
              "audioStart": 229.762,
              "audioEnd": 234.137
            },
            {
              "text": "His life was full of adventure from that time forward.",
              "audioStart": 235,
              "audioEnd": 237.688
            },
            {
              "text": "The other creatures were happy with their new noses as well.",
              "audioStart": 238.55,
              "audioEnd": 241.312
            },
            {
              "text": "They used their long parts to reach food in high places.",
              "audioStart": 242.175,
              "audioEnd": 245.15
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything was peaceful in the group, and no one complained anymore.",
              "audioStart": 246.012,
              "audioEnd": 249.438
            },
            {
              "text": "The young animal continued to ask questions for the rest of his days.",
              "audioStart": 250.3,
              "audioEnd": 253.8
            }
          ]
        }
